  "content": "<h5><strong>簡易採石機</strong>新增：</h5><ul>\n<li>燃料驅動採石機</li>\n<li>電力驅動採石機</li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#f00\">警告：</span></p><ul>\n<li>請勿在同一區塊內放置2台以上採石機，否則會爆炸！</li>\n<li><strong>本模組需搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/247401\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://curseforge.zeith.org/api/v2/logo?id=247401\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;HammerLib</a></strong></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\"></p><p>燃料驅動採石機運作方式：</p><ul>\n<li>使用任何燃料進行挖掘</li>\n<li>1個煤炭（或木炭）可挖掘96個方塊</li>\n<li>僅能挖掘單一區塊</li>\n<li>無法安裝升級模組</li>\n</ul><p>電力驅動採石機運作方式：</p><ul>\n<li>可使用RF或燃料運作</li>\n<li>需提供<strong>至少</strong> 200 RF/tick才能運作</li>\n<li>同樣僅挖掘單一區塊</li>\n<li>最多可安裝5個升級模組</li>\n</ul><p>兩種採石機都會將收集到的物品輸出到相鄰容器（如箱子），否則物品將掉落地面。</p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\"></p><p><strong>採石機合成配方</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>燃料驅動採石機配方：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/31iieit.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"154\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>預設電力驅動採石機配方：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/rUPL2VU.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"155\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>簡易版電力驅動採石機配方：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mlXkhli.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"0\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>可透過<strong>設定檔</strong>選擇合成配方</p>\n</div><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\"></p><p><strong>採石機操作介面</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>燃料驅動採石機介面</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GUFIWoN.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"302\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/G7uH2U1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"251\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>電力驅動採石機介面</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VhNg4rk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"300\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/QAm7o3O.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"256\"></p>\n</div><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\"></p><p><strong>升級模組</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>自\"9r\"版本起，電力驅動採石機新增升級系統！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ZrgATHw.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ztCFTOo.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"401\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/nAQjpcK.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"391\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xjnYR3N.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"403\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/oIPdx4t.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"374\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5KQq2sc.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"380\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5rIXXHD.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"898\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ZoBXibV.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"890\"></p>\n</div><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\"></p><h5><strong>特別感謝：</strong></h5><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Ircmaan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://dccg.herokuapp.com/cfmember/Ircmaan/avatar\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp;Ircmaan</a>&nbsp;</strong>提供靈感與動力</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/EndermanWhoSearchTheBeast\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"http://dccg.herokuapp.com/cfmember/EndermanWhoSearchTheBeast/avatar\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp; EndermanWhoSearchTheBeast</strong></a> 提供材質繪製</li>\n</ul><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>使用權限：</strong></p><ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>可將本模組用於自製模組包</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>未經許可不得轉載至其他網站（需提供CurseForge下載連結並私訊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fme.zeith.gay%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/icons/zeitheron.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;Zeitheron</a>或透過Discord聯繫）</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>不得將本模組（及DragonForge團隊其他模組）整合至自有模組中，但允許開發擴充套件（建議事先私訊告知）</strong></li>\n</ul><p><strong>注意：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><strong>僅支援本模組最新對應的Minecraft版本，不提供舊版支援！</strong></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fds.zeith.org%252fdev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ds.zeith.org/cards/dev.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"170\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想要討論或需要API協助？</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>歡迎加入Discord伺服器並追蹤Zeitheron的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252fZeithTwitter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/favicons/twitter.ico\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">Twitter</a>！</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>若想贊助開發，可透過<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/zeitheron\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/favicon/favicon-32x32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;Patreon</a>支持</strong></p>",
